     "prompt": "Solve $6c^2+5c-21=0$.",
     "answerSpaceMm": 40,
     "answer": {
      "short": "$c=\\frac32$ or $c=-\\frac73$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}6c^2+5c-21&=0\\\\6c^2+14c-9c-21&=0\\\\2c(3c+7)-3(3c+7)&=0\\\\(2c-3)(3c+7)&=0\\\\c=\\frac32\\ \\text{or}\\ c&=-\\frac73\\end{align*}$$"
     }
